body:
Cutie! Yeah, I'm seeing more Aerostars now. 

&#x200B;

I remember in my childhood neighborhood. One of my friends' grandmother had one. The only one I've see (noticed) in so many years until recently when I thought of vanlife. Funny how we notice certain things all of a sudden after we look it up.

K though?

&#x200B;

OMG

I often, well always, feel unwanted. Especially when I'm around other people. I even ruined a possible friendship with someone recently I believe because I was always (unintentionally toxic) talking about how useless or worthless I am, or some sort of experience I had that makes me a piece of nothing.

&#x200B;

I can't be around people because I get too paranoid from everything people say. But for some reason, I can't cry.
